Local changes (2026-10-22): unique package/namespace, independent Stop callback
group with a two-thread executor, injectable backend for robot-free tests, and
no state publication after failed native reads. Native action commands, units,
parameters, result mapping, and state fields are retained.

This package installs only to the PI05 deployment overlay. It does not replace
the system franka_gripper package or the GELLO collection installation.
